OL,3,GNEWSAFunding set to look into new Metro
OL,4,Astation                                
OL,6,FA #150,000 pot is set to be approved to
OL,7,Flook into plans for a new Metro        
OL,8,Fstation.                               
OL,10,FThe cash would fund a feasibility study
OL,11,Ffor a new Metro station in South       
OL,12,FTyneside, between the stations of Pelaw
OL,13,Fand Hebburn, in the Mill Lane area.    
OL,15,FIt is part of plans worth #2m to       
OL,16,Fupgrade the Tyne and Wear railway      
OL,17,Fnetwork, which will be discussed by the
OL,18,FNorth East Mayoral Strategic Authority 
OL,19,F(NEMSA) next week.                     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
