OL,3,GNEWSAFunding set to look into new Metro
OL,4,Astation                                
OL,6,FA report to be presented to the cabinet
OL,7,Fsaid the funding was to "accelerate the
OL,8,Fdevelopment of rail interventions      
OL,9,Facross the North East" and "support the
OL,10,Fcreation of a stronger pipeline of     
OL,11,Fschemes capable of securing future     
OL,12,Finvestment".                           
